      {
        "id": "the-top-end-rebuild-was-not-the-only-question-debris-had-circulated-through-the-oil-system",
        "title": "The top-end rebuild was not the only question. Debris had circulated through the oil system.",
        "description": "With shattered guide pieces and metal particles throughout the oil system, the specialist could not fully know whether the turbocharger or bottom end had already been affected without further disassembly.",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": "h3",
            "id": "",
            "text": "Path A"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Top-end rebuild only — new valves, rockers, camshaft (if needed), timing chain kit. Bottom end remains untouched."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "£2,200–£3,500"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "If debris caused unseen bottom-end damage, future failure is possible."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": "h3",
            "id": "",
            "text": "Path B"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Full reconditioned engine."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "£3,500–£5,500"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Eliminates all risk of hidden bottom-end damage. Complete warranty coverage."
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "/case-studies/assets/5.1-bmw-n47-turbo-oil-risk.png",
            "alt": "BMW N47 turbo and oil pump contamination diagram showing debris risk from chain failure",
            "width": "",
            "height": ""
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The owner chose Path A - a top-end rebuild for £2,800. The specialist confirmed the bottom end appeared undamaged. The owner accepted the small risk of future issues in exchange for saving £2,000-£3,000."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Fork in the road"
          }
