      {
        "id": "the-dealer-wanted-a-new-engine-the-specialist-could-save-the-existing-top-end",
        "title": "The dealer wanted a new engine. The specialist could save the existing top end.",
        "description": "The vehicle was worth approximately £4,000–£7,000 before failure. A £2,800 top-end rebuild was well within the vehicle's value. A £9,000 dealer new engine was financial suicide.",
        "blocks": [
